{"seq":58,"slug":"time-series-analysis","title":"时间序列分析","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 时间序列分析\n\n时间序列分析研究按时间顺序排列的观测数据中隐藏的结构——趋势、季节性、周期与噪声——并据此对未来做出可量化的预测。本 hub 从应用统计方法的视角出发，覆盖从经典 ARIMA 到 2026 年时间序列基础模型（Chronos-2、TimesFM-2.5、Moirai-2.0）的完整方法谱系，面向需要在工程实践中选择、实现与评估预测系统的开发者。\n\n## 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n- **随机过程**（`23_stochastic-processes`）侧重概率空间上的理论构造（布朗运动、鞅、遍历性），本 hub 关注的是面向数据的建模与预测方法，而非测度论推导。\n- **傅里叶分析**（`29_fourier-analysis`）深入频域的数学理论（收敛性、Parseval 定理），本 hub 仅将谱方法作为诊断工具使用，不讨论纯数学证明。\n- **贝叶斯统计**（`56_bayesian-statistics`）讲后验推断的一般框架，本 hub 在状态空间模型部分借用贝叶斯滤波思想，但不展开先验选择的哲学讨论。\n- **随机微积分**（`52_stochastic-calculus`）聚焦 Itô 积分与 SDE，本 hub 的 GARCH 建模止步于离散时间波动率，不进入连续时间领域。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读：先在「基础工具」中建立平稳性、分解、自相关三把解剖刀，再进入「经典模型」掌握 ARIMA / 指数平滑 / GARCH 三大支柱，然后在「现代方法」中了解 Prophet 自动化预测、深度学习模型与状态空间滤波，最后在「实践」章节中学习评估指标、多元分析与异常检测。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 概率与数理统计基础（期望、方差、条件分布、假设检验）\n- 线性代数基础（矩阵运算、特征值分解）\n- Python 编程经验（NumPy / pandas 数据操作）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础工具","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stationarity-transformations","title":"平稳性与数据变换","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/foundations/stationarity-transformations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"decomposition-trend-seasonality","title":"分解方法与趋势季节性","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/foundations/decomposition-trend-seasonality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"autocorrelation-spectral","title":"自相关分析与谱方法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/foundations/autocorrelation-spectral"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"classical-models","title":"经典模型","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arima-family","title":"ARIMA 族模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models/arima-family"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exponential-smoothing","title":"指数平滑方法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models/exponential-smoothing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"garch-volatility","title":"GARCH 与波动率建模","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models/garch-volatility"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-methods","title":"现代方法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prophet-automated-forecasting","title":"Prophet 与自动化预测","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods/prophet-automated-forecasting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deep-learning-forecasting","title":"深度学习预测模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods/deep-learning-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-space-kalman","title":"状态空间模型与卡尔曼滤波","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods/state-space-kalman"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forecast-evaluation-metrics","title":"预测评估与误差度量","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/practice/forecast-evaluation-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multivariate-time-series","title":"多元时间序列分析","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/practice/multivariate-time-series"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anomaly-detection-changepoint","title":"异常检测与变点分析","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/practice/anomaly-detection-changepoint"}]}]}